# NODE_ENV=production   # set for `npm start` to use prebuilt .next/

# --- Split deploy (Vercel + separate WS host) ---
#
# On Vercel (Next.js frontend), set this to your WS host URL:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SOCKET_URL=https://your-ws.onrender.com
#
# On the WS host (Render / Railway / Fly), restrict origins:
#   CORS_ORIGINS=https://yourapp.vercel.app
#
# For local dev, leave both unset — the combined server.ts handles both.
